WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.524
Sam's plan for Product Night has two open to-dos. Sam opens a chat and asks the agent to take care of them.

00:00:11.524 --> 00:00:19.174
The agent reads the plan and the RSVP list and gets to work. Sam puts the chat away.

00:00:19.174 --> 00:00:27.977
Minutes later the agent is done. The meal counts land in the plan, both to-dos are ticked, and a Door check-in app opens in a new tab.

00:00:27.977 --> 00:00:39.064
The agent says what it did, in a few plain sentences.

00:00:39.064 --> 00:00:41.872
Sam opens the app.

00:00:41.872 --> 00:01:03.869
The check-in app the agent built: search a name, tap a guest to check them in, and the count goes up.
